WEBVTT

NOTE Video ID: 6IrAuQe24xM
Language: en

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:35.425
Today is a very great day for us,
also it is 'Vasant Panchami'.

00:16:36.386 --> 00:16:40.075
Moreover it's National day today.

00:16:40.443 --> 00:16:44.940
So many people struggled to see this day,

00:16:45.322 --> 00:16:48.075
lot of them had sacrificed their lives.

00:16:48.944 --> 00:16:55.444
Lot of things like this had happened
but we haven´t yet come to that level

00:16:55.654 --> 00:17:03.247
where we are aware that
people regained this country through

00:17:03.272 --> 00:17:09.755
immense hard work and great sacrifice.

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:14.344
Even when we called up
the rebellion in this country,

00:17:14.369 --> 00:17:19.549
Gandhiji thought that as the
real wealth of this counrty

00:17:21.625 --> 00:17:25.171
is spiritual

00:17:25.246 --> 00:17:28.993
and spiritual strength doesn´t
exist in violence but in non-violence.

00:17:29.018 --> 00:17:32.764
Therefore he organised
everything based on non-violence.

00:17:33.261 --> 00:17:37.011
We have won the country
without any violence.

00:17:37.268 --> 00:17:41.216
When this happened,
we did not realize that

00:17:41.241 --> 00:17:45.042
now this immense wealth we got,

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:49.388
this treasure, the diamond we received,

00:17:49.406 --> 00:17:52.150
which socket to fit in.

00:17:52.445 --> 00:17:58.045
So the socket must be of this soil

00:17:58.062 --> 00:18:04.964
and the socket of this
soil is of spiritual strength.

00:18:05.005 --> 00:18:06.752
We don´t have anything else.

00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:09.578
The most important thing
that exists in this country

00:18:09.603 --> 00:18:12.253
is the essence of the entire
world-spiritual power.

00:18:12.253 --> 00:18:16.754
And on this power of the self
the setting should be mounted .

00:18:16.754 --> 00:18:21.265
As long as the setting of the independence
is not based on Self-Realisation,

00:18:21.909 --> 00:18:23.564
this country won´t get it´s welfare.

00:18:23.917 --> 00:18:29.561
But for that, we should create people,
who have received their Self-Realization.

00:18:29.685 --> 00:18:36.185
But still I see that even the
people who got their Self-Realization

00:18:36.554 --> 00:18:44.554
they behave with a narrow mindset and
live with a quarrelsome nature.

00:18:45.921 --> 00:18:50.877
Yesterday all these things
distressed me so much that,

00:18:50.912 --> 00:18:54.860
I have decided not to
talk about it anymore.

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:59.035
Where did this internal
strife among us come from?

00:18:59.135 --> 00:19:02.083
We say that in Maharashtra

00:19:02.383 --> 00:19:05.635
it has killed us.

00:19:05.635 --> 00:19:08.889
It made us suffer. Why?

00:19:09.254 --> 00:19:11.757
That's because we took to addictions.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.826
You might be surprised,
if some addictions afect

00:19:14.851 --> 00:19:17.502
Vishuddhi chakra,
then one loses wisdom.

00:19:17.502 --> 00:19:19.411
That person doesn´t behave properly.

00:19:19.411 --> 00:19:25.412
He lies and he´s not
aware of his wrong doings.

00:19:25.412 --> 00:19:31.165
These addictions have grown so much in
our country and on such a large scale,

00:19:31.165 --> 00:19:35.664
that people do not notice that
they are suffering because of it.

00:19:36.662 --> 00:19:39.167
Thus the people lie a lot,

00:19:39.167 --> 00:19:41.414
They are behaving so badly.

00:19:41.414 --> 00:19:44.415
And a lot of false transaction
is going on in the world

00:19:44.415 --> 00:19:46.915
To get rid of
this falsehood, first all

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.960
the addictions should be abondoned.

00:19:48.984 --> 00:19:53.380
One who doesn´t completely give up
an addiction, won´t be good natured.

00:19:53.480 --> 00:20:01.480
He´ll be dishonest, will lie &amp;
will convert all the truth in falsehood.

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:07.481
So many people struggled
their entire lives for this great day,

00:20:07.481 --> 00:20:09.067
many of them sacrificed their lifves,

00:20:09.432 --> 00:20:11.232
many have shed their blood.

00:20:11.314 --> 00:20:15.248
We´ve struggled for the
independence since time immemorial.

00:20:15.272 --> 00:20:19.206
Now for the`Self´, to know the self system,

00:20:19.583 --> 00:20:23.792
one should pledge that we will
not take to any addiction

00:20:23.792 --> 00:20:24.793
anymore.

00:20:25.291 --> 00:20:26.791
This is not a difficult task.

00:20:27.292 --> 00:20:30.543
I see people from foreign
countries are so sharp witted that

00:20:30.543 --> 00:20:34.544
once they get their realisation, the next
day they leave everything &amp; become

00:20:34.544 --> 00:20:37.298
free as if they weren´t the same people.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.801
As if a lotus comes up in a
moment and gets fragrant.

00:20:41.801 --> 00:20:43.795
But it´s not so in our country.

00:20:43.795 --> 00:20:46.742
In our country there´s always
something going on,

00:20:46.773 --> 00:20:48.172
this habit or that habit.

00:20:48.172 --> 00:20:53.173
Even after being ten years in sahajayoga,
why don´t people make progress?

00:20:53.173 --> 00:20:57.672
It´s because they haven´t been
able to relieve themselves of addiction.

00:20:58.426 --> 00:21:00.171
This slavery should end.

00:21:00.171 --> 00:21:02.138
The enslavement to addiction
must come to an end.

00:21:02.636 --> 00:21:05.632
The other one is slavery to
a guru which is terrible here.

00:21:05.882 --> 00:21:08.135
I met a gentleman yesterday who´s

00:21:08.384 --> 00:21:09.882
in sahajayoga since many years.

00:21:09.882 --> 00:21:12.137
But he isn´t free from
his slavery to `aguru´ yet.

00:21:12.137 --> 00:21:14.135
So he is still in trouble.

00:21:14.383 --> 00:21:15.885
No one listens to these things,

00:21:15.885 --> 00:21:17.392
Nobody believes it.

00:21:17.392 --> 00:21:23.881
But if your guru is wrong, then you have
seen that you suffer it´s consequences.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.289
This slavery, should be finished.

00:21:26.389 --> 00:21:31.643
You should keep in mind that
the people who come from aguru

00:21:31.684 --> 00:21:33.732
are physically afflicted.

00:21:33.732 --> 00:21:39.981
If your guru can´t keep your body alright,
then why to accept enslavery of such guru?

00:21:40.485 --> 00:21:42.986
This is superstition and it is a
Tamasic (Left side) symptom.

00:21:43.090 --> 00:21:48.097
In the Tamasic symptoms, Shrikrishna
said that when a person becomes tamasic,

00:21:48.097 --> 00:21:51.596
he gets completely
trapped in wrong things.

00:21:51.596 --> 00:21:53.993
And considering that wrong as truth,

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:58.931
he keeps wandering
around the same place like an

00:21:59.055 --> 00:22:02.395
ox yoked to the oil press
with a blinder on eyes.

00:22:02.595 --> 00:22:06.694
And no matter how much you tell him
that it´s wrong, he doesn´t beleive it;

00:22:06.694 --> 00:22:08.193
it doesn´t enter into his brain.

00:22:09.197 --> 00:22:12.446
This `Tamasic´ tendency exists
especially in our Maharashtra

00:22:12.446 --> 00:22:15.944
because we took too
much to the addictions here.

00:22:15.944 --> 00:22:20.444
The traditions &amp; the customs in
which we have grown up uptill now

00:22:20.444 --> 00:22:23.084
we never put a curb on that.

00:22:23.582 --> 00:22:28.057
Now for example, we have a custom to fast.

00:22:28.102 --> 00:22:30.820
If you ask: who said it, in
which scripture is mentioned?

00:22:31.220 --> 00:22:33.224
No one can show.

00:22:33.573 --> 00:22:36.292
If you are fond of fasting all the time,

00:22:36.292 --> 00:22:40.415
then you will get what you are desiring.

00:22:41.042 --> 00:22:44.164
In our country anyway people are starving.

00:22:45.667 --> 00:22:49.661
Then why to fast even more,
I do not understand.

00:22:49.916 --> 00:22:53.557
If you´re so much interested in
fasting,then you´ll starve to death.

00:22:53.557 --> 00:22:57.921
It seems next life you´ll starve.
You want fasting, then have it.

00:22:59.573 --> 00:23:01.921
You should get what
you´re interested in.

00:23:01.921 --> 00:23:06.260
So better you fast.
Then let die of hunger.

00:23:06.511 --> 00:23:08.063
Then why to cry?

00:23:08.115 --> 00:23:10.410
Inspite of having
everything to eat, you don´t

00:23:10.434 --> 00:23:12.529
want to eat &amp; that too
in the name of God.

00:23:12.529 --> 00:23:15.533
If you fast, it´s ok but
don´t do it in the name of God.

00:23:15.781 --> 00:23:19.032
Then they´ve invented
`Bhakti-Marg´, the path of devotion,

00:23:19.032 --> 00:23:21.524
But that´s the path, not the goal.

00:23:21.524 --> 00:23:22.774
This should be kept in mind.

00:23:23.781 --> 00:23:27.644
Ànanya Bhakti´ (Exclusive
devotion) is told by Krishna.

00:23:27.892 --> 00:23:31.007
The path of devotion
is not just to play the crotals,

00:23:31.031 --> 00:23:34.145
walking long
distance bare footed,

00:23:34.611 --> 00:23:36.893
weraring tattered clothes like beggar,

00:23:37.114 --> 00:23:41.349
going there playing the
manjeera, and to break the head.

00:23:41.603 --> 00:23:43.575
They call it devotional path.

00:23:43.575 --> 00:23:46.571
Who told this?

00:23:47.474 --> 00:23:51.558
Dnyaneshwar didn´t say
that you should go performing

00:23:51.582 --> 00:23:55.345
`Dindi procession´or
reciting 'Hare Rama Hare´

00:23:55.345 --> 00:23:59.093
or `Krishna Krishna or Vitthal Vitthal´.

00:23:59.093 --> 00:24:01.346
It´s not written anywhere.

00:24:04.344 --> 00:24:06.702
We don´t want to read
what they had written.

00:24:06.702 --> 00:24:09.200
But we ought to understand
what they explained.

00:24:09.200 --> 00:24:15.075
Dnyaneshwar said: "Aata
Vishwatmake...Toshawe.

00:24:15.075 --> 00:24:18.830
Oh God, the spirit of the
universe, be pleased,

00:24:18.830 --> 00:24:21.218
Be content by

00:24:21.313 --> 00:24:26.723
whatever sacrifice I´ve
done with my speech!"

00:24:27.079 --> 00:24:29.392
And then what does he
expect?: "May you be pleased

00:24:29.416 --> 00:24:31.584
to grant me `Pasaydan´
(boon of grace)".

00:24:31.952 --> 00:24:33.706
This `Pasaydan´,
which´s been given to you.

00:24:35.203 --> 00:24:38.202
The vibrations you have
been given, is `Pasaydaan´.

00:24:40.203 --> 00:24:43.303
"May the darkness in the minds of sinful
&amp; evil people be dispelled!" Did it?

00:24:43.911 --> 00:24:47.161
Did ignorance of these people who
go on playing manjeera vanish?

00:24:47.661 --> 00:24:53.414
Weak, too thin, withered like paupers
not having even proper clothes on body!

00:24:53.613 --> 00:24:57.161
It makes you cry; where did
these malnourished come from?

00:24:57.161 --> 00:25:00.801
And they call themselves
devotees of Shri Hari!

00:25:01.654 --> 00:25:09.651
Can these miserable people be devotees of
the one who gifted golden Dwarka to Sudama?

00:25:11.402 --> 00:25:14.383
Why do you defame Krishna?

00:25:14.383 --> 00:25:18.381
Be a devotee of somebody
else, fraud Babaji (fake guru)

00:25:18.381 --> 00:25:22.632
who has many wrinkles on their
faces. There´re many of them.

00:25:23.380 --> 00:25:25.132
Devote yourself to them.

00:25:25.379 --> 00:25:27.770
But why do you defame Shri Krishna?

00:25:28.020 --> 00:25:31.270
Didn´t you read the
description of his face?

00:25:32.024 --> 00:25:34.519
Didn´t you read
about his brilliance?

00:25:34.519 --> 00:25:38.020
Nobody told that he
lived like a begger.

00:25:38.020 --> 00:25:40.884
Even though he used to
herd the cows, he always

00:25:40.908 --> 00:25:43.771
wore the crown of pecock
feathers on the head.

00:25:43.771 --> 00:25:46.260
We only heard about
him being decked up.

00:25:46.260 --> 00:25:50.501
Have you ever heard of him carrying
a sling(bag) in his hands for limosna

00:25:50.501 --> 00:25:52.270
and tobacco in the mouth?

00:25:56.670 --> 00:25:58.991
This is our situation.

00:25:58.991 --> 00:26:03.891
But we never think about it. Moreover
to apply black ash spot on the forehead.

00:26:04.142 --> 00:26:06.642
Did he use to apply black
ash spot on the forehead?

00:26:07.890 --> 00:26:12.890
He used to apply a pretty
sandalwood mark on the forehead.

00:26:13.139 --> 00:26:16.727
Even if you see Him
everywhere with this mark,

00:26:16.751 --> 00:26:20.740
still why do you walk
around with black ash spot?

00:26:20.740 --> 00:26:23.326
By that black ash mark
spoiling your agnya chakra

00:26:23.351 --> 00:26:27.189
you´ll enter more into the Tamasic
nature (darkness of the left side).

00:26:29.354 --> 00:26:32.602
But then you say: "Mataji,
how come you say so?"

00:26:33.179 --> 00:26:37.180
I want to say whatever is the
truth and I must tell it to you.

00:26:37.180 --> 00:26:39.470
Then in future if you get
diseases like cancer

00:26:39.495 --> 00:26:41.679
or diseases related to
vishudhhi chakra

00:26:41.679 --> 00:26:45.180
or any other disease, then
you´ll ask, Mataji, how did this happen

00:26:45.180 --> 00:26:50.821
even if we´re Warkaris(devotees)?
That means to blame God.

00:26:51.324 --> 00:26:53.820
This Tamasic tendency
should go away, going with

00:26:53.820 --> 00:26:58.411
blinders on eyes, accepting anything
&amp; saying we´re in the path of devotion.

00:26:58.411 --> 00:27:00.281
What does it mean by path?

00:27:00.330 --> 00:27:03.283
God has said, practice
devotion in unity with God.

00:27:03.283 --> 00:27:05.830
Krishna explained it
clearly: if you give me anything,

00:27:05.855 --> 00:27:07.980
flowers, fruit, or even
water, I´ll accept it.

00:27:08.280 --> 00:27:11.233
But do it with whole hearted devotion.

00:27:11.233 --> 00:27:14.330
What more can he break his
head to get it into your brains?

00:27:14.331 --> 00:27:16.130
When does Ananya Bhakti occur?

00:27:16.130 --> 00:27:19.410
When you are one with God.

00:27:19.560 --> 00:27:21.555
When self realisation dawns upon you.

00:27:21.555 --> 00:27:24.765
Then your devotion aquires
some meaning after that.

00:27:25.762 --> 00:27:28.752
We defame such Krishna everywhere.

00:27:28.752 --> 00:27:31.750
Here as well as abroad.

00:27:32.000 --> 00:27:36.252
Where is Lord Krishna and
where are the Warakaris(devotees)?

00:27:36.553 --> 00:27:39.477
I don´t see any connection between them.

00:27:43.805 --> 00:27:51.554
So, whatever is good, the best from
ancient should be accepted and

00:27:51.554 --> 00:27:54.801
which has been imposed upon us
unnecessarily should be left.

00:27:54.801 --> 00:27:58.809
In Sahajayoga,
we do Bhakti (devotion),

00:27:59.301 --> 00:28:02.724
everything, but only
after self-realization.

00:28:02.724 --> 00:28:04.524
Before that we don´t do it.

00:28:04.774 --> 00:28:07.275
Secondly, we don´t do fasting.

00:28:07.275 --> 00:28:10.527
If you want to fast, then do it.
I´m realy fasting just now.

00:28:11.270 --> 00:28:15.270
I always fast because of you.

00:28:15.270 --> 00:28:18.271
Sometimes no lunch,
sometimes no dinner.

00:28:18.271 --> 00:28:20.024
Something is always going on.

00:28:20.024 --> 00:28:23.022
So I don´t need to fast.

00:28:23.022 --> 00:28:27.527
But even if you want to do it,
do it for physical reason if needed.

00:28:28.274 --> 00:28:30.772
Otherwise don´t complain if you
have stomach related problem.

00:28:31.724 --> 00:28:34.024
So we need to understand
that we´re moving

00:28:34.048 --> 00:28:36.526
towards Tamasik (Left side) nature,

00:28:36.526 --> 00:28:39.773
now we don´t want to
go towards Rajasik (Right side) nature.

00:28:39.773 --> 00:28:43.275
These (western) people are
of Rajasic(right side) nature.

00:28:43.275 --> 00:28:47.985
They don´t know, what´s
wrong and what´s right.

00:28:47.985 --> 00:28:49.987
For them it´s the same.

00:28:50.234 --> 00:28:52.735
One wonders-they are
human beings or animals!

00:28:52.735 --> 00:28:58.985
They don´t even understand which
things to accept &amp; which not to.

00:28:58.985 --> 00:29:02.985
People who don´t understand
this difference, are Rajasic.

00:29:03.231 --> 00:29:08.233
And if this right sided state
takes hold, a big problem arises.

00:29:08.233 --> 00:29:12.737
Because such people are
bewildered and completely confused.

00:29:12.737 --> 00:29:14.807
So you don´t know
what to explain to them.

00:29:14.807 --> 00:29:17.803
Because they say:
"What's wrong with this?"

00:29:17.803 --> 00:29:22.579
Now in London there´s a new fashion, as
such everyday something new comes up.

00:29:22.674 --> 00:29:24.175
Now a new one came up

00:29:24.175 --> 00:29:30.174
since four years: to pinch
the needles into your mouth.

00:29:31.444 --> 00:29:37.882
If not, then to insert the pins and
to walk around with coloured hair.

00:29:38.231 --> 00:29:42.883
I asked, why do you do this?
they said: "What's wrong with this?"

00:29:42.883 --> 00:29:45.245
So tell me now, "What's
wrong with this?" Is there

00:29:45.269 --> 00:29:47.631
any answer? Nothing;
except "You are foolish".

00:29:52.022 --> 00:29:54.275
So they do such foolishness.

00:29:54.614 --> 00:29:58.364
And even if you try to explain
it to them they don´t agree.

00:29:58.364 --> 00:30:00.061
Because they think,
they know everything,

00:30:00.061 --> 00:30:01.116
what's wrong or bad.

00:30:01.116 --> 00:30:02.603
"Why do you give advice?"

00:30:02.603 --> 00:30:05.688
Means demon is good,
a wicked person is good,

00:30:05.713 --> 00:30:08.629
the imposter is good,
Mahatma(saint) is good,

00:30:08.853 --> 00:30:12.100
and God is also good. Everybody
is good, all are the same.

00:30:12.357 --> 00:30:15.601
Hitler is good and Krishna too,

00:30:15.601 --> 00:30:17.243
not to differentiate between them.

00:30:17.243 --> 00:30:19.242
No one should be called
as bad, all are good.

00:30:19.242 --> 00:30:21.239
Not to call bad anyone.

00:30:21.239 --> 00:30:22.994
This is the Rajasic nature.

00:30:22.994 --> 00:30:24.994
And now with this Rajasic nature

00:30:24.994 --> 00:30:27.743
as you are making progress now,

00:30:27.743 --> 00:30:29.495
because you are progressive country,

00:30:29.495 --> 00:30:33.244
I have a humble request that you
shouldn´t progress in that direction.

00:30:33.244 --> 00:30:36.247
Now we must make a
progress in upward direction

00:30:36.247 --> 00:30:40.198
piercing through our Sahastrar Chakra and

00:30:40.223 --> 00:30:44.019
attaining that higher state.

00:30:44.493 --> 00:30:47.245
So, if a question arises in the
mind: what's wrong with this or that?

00:30:47.469 --> 00:30:48.960
Why to do this or that?

00:30:48.960 --> 00:30:51.967
Then be sure that we´ve become Rajasic.

00:30:51.967 --> 00:30:54.464
It's worse than Tamasic.

00:30:56.215 --> 00:30:59.991
Once, you can remove the
blinds on eyes(ignorance),

00:31:00.016 --> 00:31:03.987
but how can deliberately
put on blindfold be removed?

00:31:05.961 --> 00:31:07.713
So, don´t take to that mentality-

00:31:07.713 --> 00:31:09.711
What's wrong with this?
What's wrong with that?

00:31:09.711 --> 00:31:12.461
In Sahajayoga you are your own master.

00:31:12.461 --> 00:31:16.968
You feel vibrations in your hands and
you know what's wrong with you.

00:31:16.968 --> 00:31:18.651
So fix your vibrations.

00:31:18.651 --> 00:31:21.913
But there may come a state
when people don´t understand

00:31:21.938 --> 00:31:24.674
at all if they are mistaken or not.

00:31:25.158 --> 00:31:29.157
That situation should not occur.

00:31:29.651 --> 00:31:32.156
This is my only humble request.

00:31:32.405 --> 00:31:39.409
Today, on this auspicious ocasion to tell
you all that you´re born in this holy soil.

00:31:39.905 --> 00:31:43.407
Other day when I went to Coimbatore
they said to me, "Now you´ll live in Pune,

00:31:43.407 --> 00:31:45.156
it´s said to be
punyapattanum(sacred land)".

00:31:45.156 --> 00:31:47.153
They said with all respect.

00:31:47.254 --> 00:31:52.693
I said, "Is it? Then I might
have arrived to the wrong place".

00:31:52.717 --> 00:31:55.268
So that shouldn´t be
the case. Now whoever

00:31:55.292 --> 00:31:58.156
would come should
say: "It is clearly visible.

00:31:58.407 --> 00:32:01.903
This is what which was described".

00:32:04.154 --> 00:32:11.984
One story is told that once
Pundarikaksh came with his parents

00:32:11.984 --> 00:32:14.403
to Mumbai city o may be to Pune.

00:32:14.403 --> 00:32:16.154
I don´t not know if
Pune or elsewhere.

00:32:16.651 --> 00:32:20.353
He said to them, "I'm not
taking you anywhere now.

00:32:20.353 --> 00:32:21.896
I served you a great deal.

00:32:22.192 --> 00:32:25.142
I'll not take you any further
now, go wherever you want.

00:32:25.142 --> 00:32:28.118
I´ll not continue your
pilgrimage anymore". So

00:32:28.142 --> 00:32:31.217
they might have seen
the vaibrations and said

00:32:31.217 --> 00:32:32.963
"Please do one thing,

00:32:32.963 --> 00:32:36.713
take us out of here anyhow

00:32:36.962 --> 00:32:39.827
and then do what you
want to do." As soon as

00:32:39.851 --> 00:32:42.715
he took them out of
that village, he realized

00:32:42.715 --> 00:32:45.714
how wrong he was.
He said: "Forgive me,

00:32:45.714 --> 00:32:46.965
something had happened to me.

00:32:46.965 --> 00:32:52.464
I´ll take you to the destination".
Well, I´ve this feeling often in Pune,

00:32:52.464 --> 00:32:53.960
&amp; about Mumbai I´m sure.

00:32:53.961 --> 00:33:00.461
But now people should
decide: "Let us live up to the title

00:33:00.461 --> 00:33:05.965
bestowed upon Pune by great saints,
great masters since time immemorial.

00:33:05.965 --> 00:33:09.213
We will celebrate and will do it well".

00:33:09.342 --> 00:33:13.444
Today, all the people from
Pune should decide this in mind:

00:33:13.444 --> 00:33:19.693
"We´ll have a proper conduct befitting
Pune´s great name, &amp; great principle".

00:33:19.693 --> 00:33:20.945
We shouldn´t bother
about what

00:33:21.182 --> 00:33:23.422
others do, whether they
steal, do this or that.

00:33:23.446 --> 00:33:25.686
We needn´t worry about
that. Others are others.

00:33:26.063 --> 00:33:27.269
You are ours.

00:33:27.328 --> 00:33:35.305
Let´s abondon narrow-minded
attitudes &amp; take to great thinking.

00:33:36.262 --> 00:33:40.262
Secondly, we have the biggest
problem regarding the castes &amp; creed.

00:33:40.941 --> 00:33:43.036
Better I tell you today about that.

00:33:43.425 --> 00:33:49.413
It is written by Markandey Swaamy about
the idea of ​​caste since immemorial time.

00:33:49.498 --> 00:33:51.240
The Goddess who
resides in all beings

00:33:51.265 --> 00:33:53.133
in the form of caste.

00:33:53.133 --> 00:33:55.955
That's what we say every day,
but do we understand it?

00:33:56.178 --> 00:33:59.805
Means, the caste of Goddess is our cast.

00:33:59.805 --> 00:34:03.376
i.e. Mahakali, Mahalaxmi and Mahasaraswati,
are only three castes in this world.

00:34:03.376 --> 00:34:06.890
And the fourth one is Aadishakti's
caste which is yours.

00:34:07.227 --> 00:34:08.695
It's beyond that.

00:34:09.061 --> 00:34:13.262
Those who are Tamasic,
their cast is that of Mahakali

00:34:13.394 --> 00:34:17.734
Rajasic people have
Mahasaraswati's caste.

00:34:17.893 --> 00:34:20.909
&amp; those who are Satwik, their
caste is of Mahalakshmi.

00:34:20.988 --> 00:34:25.315
Like this there are only three
castes and the fourth one is

00:34:25.340 --> 00:34:29.520
beyond the castes,
that is to say,Trigunatit.

00:34:30.258 --> 00:34:32.791
Today you are sitting in this state now.

00:34:32.880 --> 00:34:35.946
So do not fight on castes.

00:34:35.962 --> 00:34:40.426
The people who boast: "We are
this, we are that", are really nothing.

00:34:41.521 --> 00:34:45.915
With such a brawl we complain
why we handed over kingdom to them?

00:34:45.947 --> 00:34:47.509
Shivaji was Maratha so

00:34:47.534 --> 00:34:49.068
why did the kingdom
was given to him?

00:34:49.074 --> 00:34:50.244
There´re many who say so.

00:34:50.570 --> 00:34:55.760
Now who´s sitting on your kingdom? He´s
Parsi. Why don´t you say anything to him?

00:34:55.935 --> 00:35:03.193
Why don´t all Brahmins say: "Keep a
Rajput on the seat"? He became dear to all.

00:35:03.218 --> 00:35:06.398
That man is good, no doubt.
But did anybody say anything?

00:35:06.407 --> 00:35:12.602
But in case of Shivaji
Maharaj(king) you troubled him a lot.

00:35:12.874 --> 00:35:17.732
Even Gandhiji was told to atone at Nashik.

00:35:18.137 --> 00:35:22.518
So great! How come you made
such a great man to atone?

00:35:22.986 --> 00:35:26.537
Once I asked Mahatmaji,
"Why did you go to perform penance?"

00:35:26.586 --> 00:35:29.982
He said: "If I hadn´t gone,
they would've shot me".

00:35:30.807 --> 00:35:32.807
Have you ever spared anyone?

00:35:33.601 --> 00:35:38.924
You must take people out of
that wildfire, and this mindset:

00:35:39.004 --> 00:35:41.766
to belittle others in religion.

00:35:43.639 --> 00:35:48.912
Every time the great people who
have been in this country, tried

00:35:48.976 --> 00:35:52.881
to remove this idea
from the minds of people.

00:35:53.000 --> 00:35:55.317
Eknath fed water to donkey.

00:35:55.722 --> 00:35:57.562
Naamdev was a tailor.

00:35:58.357 --> 00:36:00.761
We had a gentleman butcher.

00:36:00.801 --> 00:36:02.668
He is considered to be a saint.

00:36:02.752 --> 00:36:06.095
Tukaram also always used
to say that it would have been

00:36:06.120 --> 00:36:09.983
better if I were a Mahar(lower caste)!

00:36:10.182 --> 00:36:15.709
Why? He often told that to root
out this madness about castes.

00:36:15.734 --> 00:36:17.495
And so many miracles happened,

00:36:17.613 --> 00:36:20.531
his books, submerged in the
Indrayani(river) came up to the surface.

00:36:20.555 --> 00:36:22.706
But people failed to understand

00:36:22.722 --> 00:36:26.383
to differentiate between
sacredness and casteism.

00:36:26.563 --> 00:36:29.470
And they won´t learn because
they have blinders(of ignorance) on.

00:36:30.390 --> 00:36:33.660
So: "We can´t go along
with this caste or that,

00:36:33.740 --> 00:36:36.264
we won´t do this,
we won´t do that".

00:36:38.938 --> 00:36:44.001
People who speak like this and
spread around this attitude in this way,

00:36:44.160 --> 00:36:46.427
have worsen the
condition of our country.

00:36:46.594 --> 00:36:49.880
Still it´s needed to
think in a practical way that

00:36:49.975 --> 00:36:53.043
if a boy marries with
a girl from other caste

00:36:53.218 --> 00:36:58.757
it´s not different from the marriage in
the same caste, rather there´re advantages.

00:36:59.091 --> 00:37:03.325
Suppose,If you marry in your
caste, e.g. Maratha with Maratha,

00:37:04.055 --> 00:37:07.174
then, [bridegroom´s parents complain]
"They didn´t send anything for Diwali".

00:37:07.579 --> 00:37:12.460
It´s asked very frankly: "How
much dowry did they pay?"

00:37:12.874 --> 00:37:16.952
For marriage, they want a bride
with specific characters.

00:37:17.215 --> 00:37:21.609
But if she´s tortured, does anyone
from the community come forward to help?

00:37:22.094 --> 00:37:24.223
When the girl is sent back
due to lack of dowry,

00:37:24.248 --> 00:37:26.260
does anybody from the
community stand by her?

00:37:26.594 --> 00:37:31.919
People who insist for the same caste,
commit atrocities on their daughters.

00:37:32.054 --> 00:37:36.110
Not only that, but I feel that it´s
a medium for committing atrocities.

00:37:36.356 --> 00:37:39.028
They utilise girls to commit atrocities.

00:37:39.034 --> 00:37:42.513
To compel her to marry in the
same caste, is a medium.

00:37:42.743 --> 00:37:45.330
It is a medium to
torture those girls.

00:37:45.672 --> 00:37:50.792
We are harassing our
own daughters every day.

00:37:51.832 --> 00:37:57.565
If you get a good boy in other caste,
then what is the harm in dooing so?

00:37:57.642 --> 00:37:59.880
There should not be any objection.

00:38:00.961 --> 00:38:02.194
But it doesn´t seem so.

00:38:02.224 --> 00:38:03.924
Even that much practicality is lacking.

00:38:04.070 --> 00:38:08.981
But tomorrow if they abondon our
daughter our caste doesn´t help us.

00:38:09.000 --> 00:38:13.663
And even though it´s obvious, still
we want to marry in our own caste only.

00:38:15.361 --> 00:38:17.170
This kind of stubbornness

00:38:17.519 --> 00:38:21.662
means purposely
putting a great pressure

00:38:23.589 --> 00:38:25.136
on our daughter´s head.

00:38:25.264 --> 00:38:28.601
If you want to do for youerself in
your own caste; you may remarry.

00:38:28.815 --> 00:38:31.331
But why do you bother your daughter?

00:38:31.720 --> 00:38:35.165
Tomorrow when her mother-in-law
troubles her, why don´t you go

00:38:35.273 --> 00:38:37.741
and tell that we married
her in the same caste?

00:38:37.805 --> 00:38:41.229
You feel prestigious in your community:
"We´ve married her in our own caste".

00:38:41.253 --> 00:38:43.348
Are you going to be garlanded?

00:38:43.621 --> 00:38:45.088
What do we get? Think in this way.

00:38:47.094 --> 00:38:48.694
Specialy the women think:

00:38:49.090 --> 00:38:51.010
it should take
place within our caste

00:38:51.043 --> 00:38:55.582
Do you get a chance to show off or
what? I don´t understand.

00:38:55.944 --> 00:38:57.698
Gandhiji tried.

00:38:57.983 --> 00:39:00.516
Tilak made efforts before Gandhiji.

00:39:00.704 --> 00:39:02.837
Tilak himself married a widow.

00:39:04.188 --> 00:39:05.466
Agarkar tried too.

00:39:05.537 --> 00:39:10.616
Despite many people trying,
we didn´t live upto their efforts.

00:39:11.164 --> 00:39:16.354
Now, after coming to sahajayoga,
don´t do caste discrimination.

00:39:16.597 --> 00:39:18.723
We don´t believe in any caste.

00:39:18.795 --> 00:39:22.081
We consider only one cast.
that is sahajayoga.

00:39:22.184 --> 00:39:25.564
Sahaja Yoga is about universal religion.

00:39:26.572 --> 00:39:31.587
It´s a universal religion and
there is nothing like caste &amp; creed.

00:39:31.675 --> 00:39:35.948
There´s only one God and all of
us mankind created by Him,

00:39:36.028 --> 00:39:39.663
those who´ve achieved God now.
Now while entering the kingdom of God

00:39:39.743 --> 00:39:41.936
don´t take follies
from here over there,

00:39:42.110 --> 00:39:44.733
`Bawannakuli´(caste) and all that.

00:39:46.033 --> 00:39:51.377
One gentleman said to me, "Mataji,
talk about greatness of Lineage.

00:39:51.401 --> 00:39:56.280
I said: "Ok. Very imp for you".

00:39:56.682 --> 00:39:58.292
Where does the kul(lineage) come from?

00:39:58.333 --> 00:40:01.377
From the Goddess of your
family.

00:40:01.640 --> 00:40:03.707
That means again related
to the Goddess, isn´t it?

00:40:04.544 --> 00:40:05.744
Which is your kul(caste)?

00:40:05.798 --> 00:40:10.354
Even though we´re of different castes,
our Goddess of the family may be the same.

00:40:10.513 --> 00:40:12.377
Suppose someone's Goddess is Jagadamba,

00:40:12.639 --> 00:40:18.620
she may be of a goldsmith, a
Brahmin, Maratha or anyone else.

00:40:18.668 --> 00:40:21.167
Means their caste
is of Jagdamba. Isn´t it?

00:40:21.208 --> 00:40:23.485
Thus the kul(caste) is of Jagdamba.

00:40:23.779 --> 00:40:27.628
Traditionaly our Kul(caste) descends onto
us from the female aspect of the Goddess,

00:40:28.057 --> 00:40:29.699
not from the male aspect of the God.

00:40:30.025 --> 00:40:34.092
That means, the identity of the kul(caste)
is known on mother, and it is true too.

00:40:34.935 --> 00:40:39.736
Thats why we say 'Ya devi
sarvabhuteshu, jati rupen sansthitah'.

00:40:39.816 --> 00:40:42.094
That´s your caste. This´s
the history of Kul(lineage).

00:40:42.353 --> 00:40:44.662
I asked: "What was
Shivaji´s kul(caste)?"

00:40:45.186 --> 00:40:46.313
No one could tell.

00:40:46.375 --> 00:40:49.100
Some said, Jagadamba,
some said, Bhavani.

00:40:49.171 --> 00:40:50.648
Bhavani was his mother´s Goddess.

00:40:50.942 --> 00:40:52.109
He had Katyayani.

00:40:52.196 --> 00:40:53.799
Katyayani was his kul(caste),

00:40:54.133 --> 00:40:55.902
his family Goddess.
Now, I don´t know

00:40:56.315 --> 00:40:57.408
whether they follow that

00:40:57.432 --> 00:40:58.808
kulachar(family tradition) or not.

00:40:58.879 --> 00:41:00.249
this is Kulachar.

00:41:00.344 --> 00:41:01.364
This is kul(caste).

00:41:01.436 --> 00:41:02.666
This´s the greatness of kul.

00:41:02.682 --> 00:41:07.164
For no reason to come up with ideas:
we´re this much kuli, that much kuli.

00:41:07.189 --> 00:41:08.506
But doesn´t seem so.

00:41:08.553 --> 00:41:10.354
To drink alcohol, all
will gather together.

00:41:10.418 --> 00:41:13.152
All will sit together &amp; drink.

00:41:13.184 --> 00:41:15.104
In the same place.

00:41:15.160 --> 00:41:19.096
To drink alcohol together
there´s no problem.

00:41:19.224 --> 00:41:23.406
But at the time of drinking water,
we´ll wear holy clothes.

00:41:27.142 --> 00:41:28.888
Even to smoke cigarettes,

00:41:28.933 --> 00:41:31.733
doesn´t matter if it´s half
smoked by you, is also fine.

00:41:33.217 --> 00:41:37.341
But at the time of meal, we´re perticular
about the foodt tasted by others.

00:41:38.392 --> 00:41:41.145
For doing some
dirty work, like to steal

00:41:41.170 --> 00:41:43.816
does anybody ask, "What's your caste?"

00:41:44.056 --> 00:41:47.619
While committing thefts
when they form a team,

00:41:47.691 --> 00:41:50.627
all kinds of people steal together.

00:41:50.746 --> 00:41:52.065
Same with the politics.

00:41:52.182 --> 00:41:56.134
Nobody asks in politics:
"What is your caste?"

00:41:56.198 --> 00:41:59.142
When all fraudsters come
together, politics begins.

00:42:00.690 --> 00:42:03.227
First it´s needed to find out
how much fraudulent you are.

00:42:03.490 --> 00:42:05.632
If you are a skilled con artist,

00:42:05.680 --> 00:42:08.918
then you may join us,
we´ll get along just fine.

00:42:13.027 --> 00:42:15.915
This is the situation
we find ourselves in today

00:42:15.939 --> 00:42:18.827
that there is no
self respect in us.

00:42:19.131 --> 00:42:22.325
Because self realisation
hasn´t yet occurred,

00:42:22.350 --> 00:42:24.822
then where will self respect come from?

00:42:25.385 --> 00:42:28.879
Things which are worthless, useless

00:42:29.204 --> 00:42:31.291
have become very important &amp;

00:42:31.689 --> 00:42:33.760
there´s no attention
to the real things.

00:42:33.871 --> 00:42:35.093
This's a Tamasic symptom,

00:42:36.045 --> 00:42:40.145
and to be free from this Tamasic
tendency you should try your best.

00:42:40.768 --> 00:42:46.169
A tamasic person does
not respect himself.

00:42:46.646 --> 00:42:48.210
He isn´t bothered about himself.

00:42:48.385 --> 00:42:52.785
He doesn´t care for his self-respect nor
does he think to have self-esteem.

00:42:53.115 --> 00:42:54.686
And he keeps nitpicking all the time.

00:42:54.933 --> 00:42:57.313
Finding faults in someone or other.

00:42:57.639 --> 00:43:00.956
He does something which is
called as slyness in English.

00:43:01.289 --> 00:43:03.535
He acts insidiously.

00:43:03.726 --> 00:43:04.726
He is sly.

00:43:05.338 --> 00:43:08.885
Likewise, the Rajasic
person is agressive but open.

00:43:08.989 --> 00:43:12.155
He comes &amp; may slap you openly.

00:43:12.187 --> 00:43:16.159
If you slap him two or four times,
he will slap you back, but openly.

00:43:16.183 --> 00:43:18.155
His every act is openly.

00:43:18.766 --> 00:43:18.797


00:43:18.873 --> 00:43:20.140
Upto the extent that.....

00:43:20.272 --> 00:43:22.286
even to commit a
sin, he´ll do openly.

00:43:22.316 --> 00:43:24.316
What´s is wrong with doing it?

00:43:24.514 --> 00:43:26.386
He will say so.

00:43:26.686 --> 00:43:29.233
There´s no sense of
hesitation in doing anything.

00:43:29.258 --> 00:43:31.924
In everything thing:
"What is wrong with that?".

00:43:32.128 --> 00:43:35.017
Rather others will feel ashamed
to see them. That´s the situation.

00:43:35.870 --> 00:43:38.726
So now, know your state,

00:43:38.774 --> 00:43:40.703
find out what your cast is.

00:43:40.894 --> 00:43:44.792
And in any caste if you go to
the extreem, then you are lost.

00:43:45.165 --> 00:43:50.125
So you should go beyond
these castes &amp; become Gunatit.

00:43:50.887 --> 00:43:54.391
So going beyond the
Gunas(Tamas, Rajas, Sattwa) &amp;

00:43:54.415 --> 00:43:57.851
establishing in that state you
should get spiritualy enriched.

00:43:58.264 --> 00:44:00.597
That richnees should manifest in you.

00:44:00.971 --> 00:44:06.104
The other characteristic of Sahajayoga is
that one should always be happy, joyful.

00:44:06.483 --> 00:44:09.755
Kabirdas said, when you get immersed in
(divine) ecstacy, it´s beyond description!

00:44:10.783 --> 00:44:12.783
If that joy doesn´t emerge in you

00:44:13.441 --> 00:44:15.441
then you are not sahajayogi;

00:44:15.775 --> 00:44:20.442
if you don´t get that carefree attitude:
If Mataji says, we´re ready to do anything.

00:44:22.032 --> 00:44:23.405
I´ve seen many people like this.

00:44:23.644 --> 00:44:25.509
I said, what are you doing?

00:44:25.660 --> 00:44:27.088
One thousand people will come.

00:44:27.692 --> 00:44:31.211
How will you do it? Mother,
we´ll mange even three thousand.

00:44:31.236 --> 00:44:35.266
What´s the big deal? It´s
sufficient if we are ten people.

00:44:35.594 --> 00:44:39.829
If you don´t experience that
enjoyment, called as carefreeness

00:44:39.980 --> 00:44:43.980
then you still haven´t
attained Sahaja Yoga.

00:44:44.306 --> 00:44:46.075
"What´s there? If Mataji says,

00:44:46.131 --> 00:44:48.250
then certainly, it´ll
happen". And it occurs.

00:44:48.829 --> 00:44:52.012
There´re many people
who have experienced this.

00:44:52.091 --> 00:44:54.602
They´ve seen how they are benefited,

00:44:54.633 --> 00:44:55.726
so much they gained.

00:44:55.730 --> 00:44:57.642
But that carefree
attitude should come in.

00:44:57.646 --> 00:44:58.912
One has to immerse in that joy.

00:44:59.079 --> 00:45:03.746
If that joy isn´t there, then I know
something is wrong with that person.

00:45:04.220 --> 00:45:06.204
He has no seriousness, he

00:45:06.482 --> 00:45:10.299
finds grievances in everything,
pays attention to trivial matters:

00:45:10.346 --> 00:45:16.807
shouldn´t to do this, shouldn´t
do that, or somehow to spoil others´joy.

00:45:17.019 --> 00:45:20.759
Such things don´t behove a sahajayogi.

00:45:20.910 --> 00:45:21.910
Be immersed in joy.

00:45:22.236 --> 00:45:26.767
If you do everything in joy, then you´ll
be surprised, how the things work out.

00:45:26.847 --> 00:45:29.647
Because you´ve entered
into the kingdom of God.

00:45:29.671 --> 00:45:32.071
Even now if you don´t
enjoy,then when will you?

00:45:34.187 --> 00:45:39.327
So today is a happy
day, a joyful day.

00:45:39.699 --> 00:45:42.667
When the flag of our
freedom got hoisted,

00:45:42.985 --> 00:45:48.643
I myself witnessed our flag being
hoisted &amp; other one being lowered.

00:45:49.253 --> 00:45:52.912
And I said that, the pride of
this flag should be maintained.

00:45:53.325 --> 00:46:00.789
And likewise, upholding our self
respect we must all fully integrate.

00:46:01.925 --> 00:46:05.607
We must achieve unity
respecting ourselves.

00:46:05.806 --> 00:46:08.565
We must immerse
in joy &amp; must enjoy.

00:46:08.635 --> 00:46:11.532
Everyone should get mixed up.

00:46:12.016 --> 00:46:15.063
Now look at these people
they´ve come from abroad.

00:46:15.143 --> 00:46:17.928
I don´t have even two
minutes to talk to them.

00:46:18.167 --> 00:46:20.309
I can´t sit with them
even for two minutes.

00:46:20.556 --> 00:46:23.921
They´ve come from so far.
I´ve never met some of them.

00:46:24.199 --> 00:46:25.199
But they are enjoying.

00:46:25.546 --> 00:46:27.537
I didn´t spend a minute with them.

00:46:27.633 --> 00:46:30.125
But they don´t mind. In our
Maharashtra isn´t llike that

00:46:30.403 --> 00:46:32.077
"Mataji didn´t come to my house,

00:46:32.141 --> 00:46:33.649
didn´t come to my premises.

00:46:34.149 --> 00:46:38.234
Haven´t been to my center",
It´s too much my, my, my.

00:46:38.440 --> 00:46:41.503
And "Mataji didn´t give me time,
Give me time".

00:46:41.774 --> 00:46:43.774
I spend all my time in Maharashtra only.

00:46:44.008 --> 00:46:46.182
There´s no time to talk to these people.

00:46:46.191 --> 00:46:49.039
I haven´t even asked them how they are,

00:46:49.159 --> 00:46:50.200
uptill now.

00:46:50.283 --> 00:46:52.389
I didn´t ask about their health.

00:46:52.504 --> 00:46:54.607
They come here,
and go back.

00:46:54.988 --> 00:46:56.662
But I can´t even meet them.

00:46:56.814 --> 00:46:59.898
When I visit their country
then we manage to meet little bit.

00:47:00.748 --> 00:47:02.890
But they never said:

00:47:02.994 --> 00:47:08.595
"Mataji, come to my place, talk to me".

00:47:08.714 --> 00:47:09.714
Never.

00:47:10.976 --> 00:47:14.492
Well, secondly, if I want to go to
someone´s, house then I´ll do.

00:47:14.619 --> 00:47:15.619
That´ll be my decesion.

00:47:16.032 --> 00:47:18.032
I would go wherever I want

00:47:18.254 --> 00:47:20.555
according to my convenience.

00:47:20.690 --> 00:47:23.642
But people say: "Why
did you go to their house?"

00:47:23.738 --> 00:47:27.191
It´s convenient for me to go there,
so I go, who are you to say so?

00:47:27.509 --> 00:47:30.476
So, they object to
my going elsewhere.

00:47:31.001 --> 00:47:32.683
They put pressure on me.

00:47:32.810 --> 00:47:38.579
This is a sign of immaturity and
stupidity. You shouldn´t do that.

00:47:38.889 --> 00:47:43.355
So don´t force me: "Come to my place for
two minutes, or for a minute". For what?

00:47:44.536 --> 00:47:45.693
Why should I come?

00:47:45.705 --> 00:47:47.601
What are you going to get from it?

00:47:47.703 --> 00:47:51.377
If by creating problmes for me,
you take away my contentment,

00:47:51.624 --> 00:47:53.354
how can I be pleased?

00:47:53.435 --> 00:47:58.640
And how will you get then blessings
from that happiness if you trouble me?

00:47:59.061 --> 00:48:02.017
So don´t insist: "Come to my house".

00:48:02.057 --> 00:48:04.811
This my, my should disapear.

00:48:05.335 --> 00:48:07.606
Which is your house? All is mine.

00:48:10.149 --> 00:48:11.469
This -my child,

00:48:12.149 --> 00:48:15.196
my house, my husband, is
all Tamasic symptom.

00:48:16.095 --> 00:48:21.634
It should be kept in mind that the
children who do `my, me´, never grow,

00:48:21.976 --> 00:48:23.229
never progress.

00:48:23.270 --> 00:48:27.324
As you are so much attached,
that you make a mistake

00:48:27.349 --> 00:48:32.751
that even if he commits two
murders, he is pampered.

00:48:34.084 --> 00:48:36.639
So being a sahajayogi
observe him with detachment.

00:48:36.690 --> 00:48:40.890
You won´t know how your child should
be unless you watch him as a witness.

00:48:40.910 --> 00:48:42.544
So don´t get so attached to him.

00:48:42.556 --> 00:48:46.388
And the society created like that is in
real sence is Gunatit(beyond gunas).

00:48:47.286 --> 00:48:52.489
That person is a true sahajayogi
and he´ll attain the great yoga.

00:48:53.124 --> 00:48:56.433
May god bless you .

00:49:16.708 --> 00:49:19.383


00:49:27.013 --> 00:49:30.219
Some communication is needed.

00:49:30.695 --> 00:49:32.671
I think that now people

00:49:32.790 --> 00:49:34.695
from pune will go to mumbai.

00:49:34.832 --> 00:49:39.015
So Mumbains, Puneins, from
such &amp; such place, Nagarians

00:49:39.253 --> 00:49:42.761
then from this lane etc.
this attitude shouldn´t exist.

00:49:44.506 --> 00:49:49.476
Everyone should meet &amp; mix with each other.
You must increase love among yourselves.

00:49:49.643 --> 00:49:53.709
You should give suggestions

00:49:54.042 --> 00:49:55.733
which will be benevolent for mankind.

00:49:56.971 --> 00:49:59.336
And everyone should travel,

00:49:59.360 --> 00:50:01.886
must meet people from other places.

00:50:02.116 --> 00:50:04.116
Today Sahaja Yoga

00:50:04.488 --> 00:50:05.557
which has

00:50:05.560 --> 00:50:08.912
spread in foreign countries is
due to sahaj yogis there, not me.

00:50:10.626 --> 00:50:13.573
Because I don´t have so much
time. I´ve my home,

00:50:13.882 --> 00:50:20.613
my husband. So I´ve at the most a
month for my tour to visit 14 countries.

00:50:20.890 --> 00:50:23.300
So I can live only 2 to
3 days in one country.

00:50:24.022 --> 00:50:27.685
But these people travel
from one place to another.

00:50:27.851 --> 00:50:31.430
They talk to people, make
necessary arrangements.

00:50:31.470 --> 00:50:33.724
They don´t sit quietely at one place.

00:50:36.715 --> 00:50:41.375
People from Pune should go out to other
places, visit people &amp; tell [s.y.] to them.

00:50:41.756 --> 00:50:44.367
But if you´re stuck in one
place, then it´s a problem.

00:50:44.819 --> 00:50:48.591
So this should be kept in mind that there
should be communication among yourselves.

00:50:49.012 --> 00:50:54.412
And when you are in touch, whatever
is useful for Sahaj Yoga should be done.

00:50:54.721 --> 00:50:55.956
Only then it will work out.

00:50:57.662 --> 00:51:01.631
But many people distort the
things when they´re told something.

00:51:01.765 --> 00:51:05.438
Mataji has told, then they
go with their ludgage

00:51:06.136 --> 00:51:09.732
and stay for a month in someone´s
house. The host came to me grumbling:

00:51:11.446 --> 00:51:16.097
Mataji he stayed for a month, now
what to do? You only had told it.

00:51:17.605 --> 00:51:19.805
I had said: `with self-respect!´

00:51:20.217 --> 00:51:23.876
There´s no need to stay in anyone´s
house. Arrange yourself somewhere.

00:51:24.209 --> 00:51:27.792
You may visit for two days. You can
meet &amp; ask about their well-being,

00:51:27.817 --> 00:51:31.265
talk to them and may decide the program.